    <string name="report_pdf_about">About this report</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_generated">Generated by the Hangry app on %1$s at %2$s from data stored on the user\'s phone.</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_sources">Vitals, sleep and activity were recorded by %1$s through Android Health Connect; lab results and readings were entered by the user, imported from Health Connect or medical records, or read from a scanned report and confirmed by the user.</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_sources_unknown">Vitals, sleep and activity come from apps and devices connected through Android Health Connect; lab results and readings were entered by the user, imported from Health Connect or medical records, or read from a scanned report and confirmed by the user.</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_method">Averages use only days with data over the last %1$d days, and nights belong to the day they end. Overnight vitals (resting heart rate, heart rate variability, blood oxygen, breathing rate) come from the main sleep where the device measured it.</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_ranges">Ranges: blood pressure per ACC/AHA 2017; glucose and HbA1c per ADA; cholesterol and triglycerides per NCEP ATP III.</string>
    <string name="report_pdf_about_disclaimer">Wearable measurements are estimates from consumer devices and are not diagnostic. This summary supports a conversation with a clinician; it is not a medical record.</string>

